al options: ",[202,214,215],{},"--config PATH"," (or ",[202,218,219],{},"$WOLF_AGENT_CONFIG","), ",[202,222,223],{},"-v",[225,226,227,240],"table",{},[228,229,230],"thead",{},[231,232,233,237],"tr",{},[234,235,236],"th",{},"Command",[234,238,239],{},"What it does",[241,242,243,254,264,278,288,302,316,331],"tbody",{},[231,244,245,251],{},[246,247,248],"td",{},[202,249,250],{},"register --url URL --token TOKEN [--bench PATH]...",[246,252,253],{},"Register the host, discover benches, write the config.",[231,255,256,261],{},[246,257,258],{},[202,259,260],{},"run",[246,262,263],{},"The daemon loop. This is what systemd runs.",[231,265,266,271],{},[246,267,268],{},[202,269,270],{},"refresh",[246,272,273,274,277],{},"As root: read again what the agent's user cannot (a Press server's benches folder and proxy; a Press proxy's access log) and save it in the config, without registering again. ",[202,275,276],{},"install.sh"," runs it on every upgrade.",[231,279,280,285],{},[246,281,282],{},[202,283,284],{},"discover [--bench PATH] [--platform auto|press|generic]",[246,286,287],{},"Show what bench discovery finds.",[231,289,290,295],{},[246,291,292],{},[202,293,294],{},"check [--from-start] [--status] [--platform …]",[246,296,297,298,301],{},"Collect once and print the JSON payload. Nothing is sent. The watchdog state goes to stderr. ",[202,299,300],{},"--status"," also asks the site for its health.",[231,303,304,309],{},[246,305,306],{},[202,307,308],{},"mark-deployment --bench NAME [--site S] [--note TEXT] [--silence 15m]",[246,310,311,312,315],{},"Put a deployment marker on the Wolf timeline. ",[202,313,314],{},"--silence"," also opens a maintenance window that mutes notifications for that bench or site.",[231,317,318,323],{},[246,319,320],{},[202,321,322],{},"test-fallback",[246,324,325,326,330],{},"Send a test message through the ",[327,328,329],"a",{"href":81},"watchdog"," fallback channels.",[231,332,333,338],{},[246,334,335],{},[202,336,337],{},"demo press|multi|single [--root DIR] [--days N] [--no-live] [--cycle MIN] [--configure]",[246,339,340],{},"Write a simulated server for this agent to read: days of history, then live traffic and incidents. For demos and tests only.",[342,343,345],"h2",{"id":344},"mark-a-deployment","Mark a deployment",[347,348,354],"pre",{"className":349,"code":350,"filename":351,"language":352,"meta":353,"style":353},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","sudo -u wolf-agent wolf-agent mark-deployment --bench frappe-bench --site erp.example.com \\\n  --note \"ERPNext v15.42 + custom app 2.3\" --silence 15m\n","deploy.sh","bash","",[202,355,356,393],{"__ignoreMap":353},[357,358,361,365,369,372,374,377,380,383,386,389],"span",{"class":359,"line":360},"line",1,[357,362,364],{"class":363},"sBMFI","sudo",[357,366,368],{"class":367},"sfazB"," -u",[357,370,371],{"class":367}," wolf-agent",[357,373,371],{"class":367},[357,375,376],{"class":367}," mark-deployment",[357,378,379],{"class":367}," --bench",[357,381,382],{"class":367}," frappe-bench",[357,384,385],{"class":367}," --site",[357,387,388],{"class":367}," erp.example.com",[357,390,392],{"class":391},"sTEyZ"," \\\n",[357,394,396,399,403,406,409,412],{"class":359,"line":395},2,[357,397,398],{"class":367},"  --note",[357,400,402],{"class":401},"sMK4o"," \"",[357,404,405],{"class":367},"ERPNext v15.42 + custom app 2.3",[357,407,408],{"class":401},"\"",[357,410,411],{"class":367}," --silence",[357,413,414],{"class":367}," 15m\n",[198,416,417,418,421,422,426,427,430,431,209],{},"The marker is a ",[202,419,420],{},"deployment"," event. Rules with ",[423,424,425],"strong",{},"Require recent deployment"," only fire after one,\nand incidents link to the latest deployment of their scope. Text passed with ",[202,428,429],{},"--note"," is sent as is,\nwithout ",[327,432,433],{"href":76},"scrubbing",[198,435,436,437,440],{},"Press and Pilot tasks, and ",[202,438,439],{},"bench migrate"," on sites running the Wolf App, are marked by themselves.",[342,442,444],{"id":443},"run-a-demo","Run a demo",[198,446,447,450,451,454,455,458],{},[202,448,449],{},"demo KIND"," lays out a simulated server under ",[202,452,453],{},"--root"," (default ",[202,456,457],{},"\u002Fhome\u002Ffrappe\u002Fdemo-KIND","). Sites are\nnames only: nothing runs behind them.",[225,460,461,474],{},[228,462,463],{},[231,464,465,468,471],{},[234,466,467],{},"Kind",[234,469,470],{},"Server",[234,472,473],{},"Deployments",[241,475,476,493,514],{},[231,477,478,483,490],{},[246,479,480],{},[202,481,482],{},"press",[246,484,485,486,489],{},"a Press app server: 3 benches, 8 sites (two with a custom domain), the Press agent's ",[202,487,488],{},"jobs.sqlite3",", nginx in Press's format",[246,491,492],{},"Press jobs, read by the agent",[231,494,495,500,507],{},[246,496,497],{},[202,498,499],{},"multi",[246,501,502,503,506],{},"plain benches: 2 benches, 6 sites (two with a custom domain), one nginx log with ",[202,504,505],{},"$host"," first",[246,508,509,510,513],{},"marked through the deployment endpoint, as ",[202,511,512],{},"mark-deployment"," does",[231,515,516,521,524],{},[246,517,518],{},[202,519,520],{},"single",[246,522,523],{},"one bench, one site",[246,525,526,527],{},"same as ",[202,528,499],{},[198,530,531],{},"Every kind has an auth.log too. Use a host or container of its own, registered under a name of its own:",[347,533,536],{"className":349,"code":534,"filename":535,"language":352,"meta":353,"style":353},"wolf-agent register --url https:\u002F\u002Fwolf.example.com --token TOKEN --hostname dokos-multi-1 --bench \u002Fhome\u002Ffrappe\u002Fdemo-multi\nwolf-agent demo multi --configure   # points the agent at the demo; checks with nothing behind them off\nwolf-agent run &                    # the agent runs first: it must open the files while they are empty\nwolf-agent demo multi               # 7 days of history, then an incident cycle every 30 minutes\n","demo host",[202,537,538,568,585,599],{"__ignoreMap":353},[357,539,540,542,545,548,551,554,557,560,563,565],{"class":359,"line":360},[357,541,204],{"class":363},[357,543,544],{"class":367}," register",[357,546,547],{"class":367}," --url",[357,549,550],{"class":367}," https:\u002F\u002Fwolf.example.com",[357,552,553],{"class":367}," --token",[357,555,556],{"class":367}," TOKEN",[357,558,559],{"class":367}," --hostname",[357,561,562],{"class":367}," dokos-multi-1",[357,564,379],{"class":367},[357,566,567],{"class":367}," \u002Fhome\u002Ffrappe\u002Fdemo-multi\n",[357,569,570,572,575,578,581],{"class":359,"line":395},[357,571,204],{"class":363},[357,573,574],{"class":367}," demo",[357,576,577],{"class":367}," multi",[357,579,580],{"class":367}," --configure",[357,582,584],{"class":583},"sHwdD","   # points the agent at the demo; checks with nothing behind them off\n",[357,586,588,590,593,596],{"class":359,"line":587},3,[357,589,204],{"class":363},[357,591,592],{"class":367}," run",[357,594,595],{"class":401}," &",[357,597,598],{"class":583},"                    # the agent runs first: it must open the files while they are empty\n",[357,600,602,604,606,608],{"class":359,"line":601},4,[357,603,204],{"class":363},[357,605,574],{"class":367},[357,607,577],{"class":367},[357,609,610],{"class":583},"               # 7 days of history, then an incident cycle every 30 minutes\n",[198,612,613,616,617,619,620,209],{},[202,614,615],{},"--bench"," names a directory that is not a bench yet, so the host registers without benches; the\ndemo's benches reach Wolf with its telemetry. For ",[202,618,482],{},", also pass ",[202,621,622],{},"--platform press",[198,624,625,626,629],{},"The demo waits until the agent tracks every file, then writes the history, which reaches Wolf\nthrough the agent's own discovery, tailers and parsers. Past host metrics, which the agent samples\nlive, go through its spool. Each cycle has a deployment followed by 4 minutes of 502s, a request\ntraceback, a failed scheduled job, a killed worker, an SSH brute force (every third one succeeds),\na web attack scan and, every other cycle, a failed bench operation (a Press Patch App job, or a\n",[202,627,628],{},"bench update"," traceback).",[198,631,632,633,216,636,639,640,643,644,647,648,651,652,655],{},"Rules look at the last minutes, so incidents open for the live cycles, not for the history.\n",[202,634,635],{},"bench --site SITE generate-demo-press",[202,637,638],{},"-multi",", ",[202,641,642],{},"-single",") with ",[202,645,646],{},"--agent-config PATH"," does the\nsame from a bench that has the agent installed, and ",[202,649,650],{},"--webhook URL"," also sends the demo's alerts\nthere. The ",[327,653,654],{"href":189},"development page"," runs it all in Docker.",[342,657,659],{"id":658},"see-the-payload","See the payload",[347,661,664],{"className":349,"code":662,"filename":663,"language":352,"meta":353,"style":353},"sudo -u wolf-agent wolf-agent check --from-start | jq '.events[] | {type, category, title}'\n","host",[202,665,666],{"__ignoreMap":353},[357,667,668,670,672,674,676,679,682,685,688,691,694],{"class":359,"line":360},[357,669,364],{"class":363},[357,671,368],{"class":367},[357,673,371],{"class":367},[357,675,371],{"class":367},[357,677,678],{"class":367}," check",[357,680,681],{"class":367}," --from-start",[357,683,684],{"class":401}," |",[357,686,687],{"class":363}," jq",[357,689,690],{"class":401}," '",[357,692,693],{"class":367},".events[] | {type, category, title}",[357,695,696],{"class":401},"'\n",[198,698,699,702,703,706],{},[202,700,701],{},"--from-start"," reads the logs from the beginning instead of the saved offsets, which is useful to\ntest a parser on an existing file. ",[202,704,705],{},"check"," never sends anything and never moves the offsets.",[708,709,710],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki